{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3321788/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ななせまるですよ↑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫、2回目を撮影させていただきました！やったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしよかったら観てくださいネ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしを動物に例えると？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リス うさぎがダントツで、猫 豆柴 フェネック 鹿 ハムスター 孔雀 ペガサス 太ったハト キリン アライグマ カワウソ 野良猫 カピバラ 馬..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、正直いままで言われたことのない動物ばっかりです(笑)犬と鹿だけ言われたことありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えていただいてありがとうございました(ｏ'∀'ｏ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3321788/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むぎ太くん元気かな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をしたいとこやけどもメモを忘れてしまったのでまた次回にまわすよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最近、さかいゆうさんの「君と僕の挽歌」って歌がすきです。めっちゃ綺麗な声で歌詞と歌い出しとかがすき！電車で絶対聴いてますえへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/23/3321788/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もがんばりましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}